<title>USA: Gottschalks in talks to form alliance.</title>
<headline>Gottschalks in talks to form alliance.</headline>
<dateline>FRESNO, Calif. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gottschalks Inc said it is in discussions with another retail company to form a strategic alliance that could lead to an increase in its department-store base by between 20 percent and 30 percent.</p>
<p>The companys aid that no agreement in principal on the terms of the alliance had been reached. It did not name the retail company with which it is in talks.</p>
<p>Gottschalks is a regional department store chain.</p>
<p>It operates 35 Gottschalks department stores and 24 Village East specialty apparel stores in California, Washington, Oregon and Nevada.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
